(1, 1, 'user', 'Tell me about your tech stack', '2026-09-24 05:36:33', '2026-09-24 05:36:33'),
(2, 1, 'assistant', 'Our primary enterprise stack pairs **Laravel 12** on the backend with **Next.js or Inertia.js React** on the frontend.\n\nWhy this architecture dominates:\n• **Sub-second navigation:** Instant page changes with zero full reloads.\n• **Search Dominance:** 100/100 Core Web Vitals and perfect SSR / SSG indexation.\n• **Rock-solid Security:** Robust ORM, queuing, and API authentication.\n\nAre you building a new application from scratch or modernizing an existing legacy codebase?', '2026-09-24 05:36:33', '2026-09-24 05:36:33'),
(3, 2, 'user', 'Hi, my email is ceo@acme-ventures.com and phone is +91 9876543210. Can you audit our site?', '2026-09-24 05:36:52', '2026-09-24 05:36:52'),
(4, 2, 'assistant', 'We provide a complimentary **48-Hour Technical SEO & Core Web Vitals Audit** for high-growth businesses.\n\nOur senior engineers evaluate:\n• Real-world LCP, FID & CLS metrics\n• Crawl budget and JS hydration bottlenecks\n• Untapped topical ranking clusters\n\nWould you like our team to analyze your domain? Share your website URL or click **Claim Free Audit** below!', '2026-09-24 05:36:52', '2026-09-24 05:36:52'),
(7, 4, 'user', 'How can I claim the 48-Hour Technical SEO & Core Web Vitals Audit?', '2026-09-24 05:42:20', '2026-09-24 05:42:20'),
(8, 4, 'assistant', 'We provide a complimentary **48-Hour Technical SEO & Core Web Vitals Audit** for high-growth businesses.\n\nOur senior engineers evaluate:\n• Real-world LCP, FID & CLS metrics\n• Crawl budget and JS hydration bottlenecks\n• Untapped topical ranking clusters\n\nWould you like our team to analyze your domain? Share your website URL or click **Claim Free Audit** below!', '2026-09-24 05:42:21', '2026-09-24 05:42:21'),
(9, 4, 'user', 'How can I claim the 48-Hour Technical SEO & Core Web Vitals Audit?', '2026-09-24 05:42:42', '2026-09-24 05:42:42'),
(10, 4, 'assistant', 'We provide a complimentary **48-Hour Technical SEO & Core Web Vitals Audit** for high-growth businesses.\n\nOur senior engineers evaluate:\n• Real-world LCP, FID & CLS metrics\n• Crawl budget and JS hydration bottlenecks\n• Untapped topical ranking clusters\n\nWould you like our team to analyze your domain? Share your website URL or click **Claim Free Audit** below!', '2026-09-24 05:42:42', '2026-09-24 05:42:42'),
(11, 4, 'user', 'Tech Stack Details', '2026-09-24 05:42:51', '2026-09-24 05:42:51'),
(12, 4, 'assistant', 'Our primary enterprise stack pairs **Laravel 12** on the backend with **Next.js or Inertia.js React** on the frontend.\n\nWhy this architecture dominates:\n• **Sub-second navigation:** Instant page changes with zero full reloads.\n• **Search Dominance:** 100/100 Core Web Vitals and perfect SSR / SSG indexation.\n• **Rock-solid Security:** Robust ORM, queuing, and API authentication.\n\nAre you building a new application from scratch or modernizing an existing legacy codebase?', '2026-09-24 05:42:51', '2026-09-24 05:42:51'),
(13, 5, 'user', 'Give me a comprehensive breakdown of all core services offered by WebRanker.', '2026-09-24 23:12:55', '2026-09-24 23:12:55'),
(14, 5, 'assistant', '**WebRanker – Core Service Portfolio**  \n\nBelow is a concise, executive‑level overview of every service line we deliver. Each offering is built on a foundation of performance‑first engineering, data‑driven growth tactics, and AI‑enhanced automation.\n\n---\n\n## 1. High‑Performance Web Development\n| Sub‑Service | What We Do | Business Impact |\n|-------------|------------|-----------------|\n| **Core Architecture** | Laravel 12 API & ORM, Next.js (React) with Inertia.js, Headless CMS integrations (Sanity, Strapi, Contentful) | Scalable, maintainable back‑ends that support millions of concurrent users |\n| **Performance Engineering** | Sub‑second page transitions, 100/100 Lighthouse scores, Core Web Vitals optimization, edge‑caching (Vercel, Cloudflare) | Faster load times → higher conversion & SEO rankings |\n| **Custom Solutions** | Enterprise SaaS platforms, high‑converting e‑commerce (Shopify‑plus, custom checkout), client portals, API ecosystems | Tailored digital products that directly drive revenue |\n| **CI/CD & DevOps** | GitHub Actions, Docker/Kubernetes, automated testing, zero‑downtime deployments | Faster time‑to‑market with rock‑solid reliability |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Technical SEO & Organic Keyword Ranking Dominance\n| Sub‑Service | What We Do | Business Impact |\n|-------------|------------|-----------------|\n| **Crawl Budget & Indexation** | Server‑side rendering, lazy‑load elimination, structured data hygiene, log‑file analysis | Google indexes every valuable page, reducing wasted crawl budget |\n| **Programmatic SEO & Topic Clustering** | Automated content pipelines, semantic clustering, internal linking graphs | Rapidly capture long‑tail authority and dominate niche SERPs |\n| **Schema.org & Knowledge Graph** | JSON‑LD implementation (FAQ, How‑To, Product, Breadcrumb, Event, Review) | Rich snippets → higher CTR & brand visibility |\n| **Rank', '2026-09-24 23:12:57', '2026-09-24 23:12:57'),
(15, 5, 'user', 'Tell me in detail about WebRanker Technical SEO and Organic Keyword Ranking Dominance services (#1 Google ranking, Schema graphs, crawl budget).', '2026-09-24 23:13:16', '2026-09-24 23:13:16'),
(16, 5, 'assistant', '### WebRanker – Technical SEO & Organic Keyword Ranking Dominance  \n*(The engine that consistently pushes our clients to the #1 slot on Google)*  \n\n---\n\n#### 1. **#1 Google Ranking Framework**  \nWe treat the #1 position as a repeatable, data‑driven system rather than a one‑off win.\n\n| Phase | Core Activities | Why It Works |\n|-------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Discovery & Intent Mapping** | • Deep keyword‑intent clustering using SERP‑level analysis (search intent, SERP features, competitor gap).<br>• Market‑level topical maps built with LLM‑augmented semantic graphs. | Guarantees we target the exact queries that drive qualified traffic and revenue. |\n| **Content Architecture** | • Pillar‑cluster model with a single authoritative “pillar” page and tightly linked supporting articles.<br>• Content briefs generated from the intent map (target word count, heading hierarchy, LSI terms, internal link anchors). | Creates a strong topical relevance signal that Google rewards with higher rankings. |\n| **On‑Page Optimization Engine** | • Automated audit of title tags, meta descriptions, H1‑H6 hierarchy, image ALT, and keyword placement.<br>• Dynamic “keyword density” control to stay within Google’s natural language thresholds.<br>• A/B testing of SERP snippets via Google Search Console & Surfer SEO integration. | Ensures every on‑page signal is fully aligned with the target query. |\n| **Authority & Trust Signals** | • High‑quality backlink acquisition strategy (digital PR, niche edits, resource page outreach).<br>• Internal link sculpting to pass PageRank from authority pages to target pages.<br>• Brand‑level trust signals (Google My Business, Trustpilot', '2026-09-24 23:13:17', '2026-09-24 23:13:17'),
(17, 5, 'user', 'How can I claim the complimentary 48-Hour Technical SEO & Core Web Vitals Audit for my website domain?', '2026-09-24 23:13:22', '2026-09-24 23:13:22'),
(18, 5, 'assistant', '**Claiming Your Complimentary 48‑Hour Technical SEO & Core Web Vitals Audit**  \n\nWe run a fast‑track, data‑rich audit that surfaces every performance, crawl‑budget, and ranking issue on your site—delivered within 48 hours of receipt. Follow the steps below and we’ll kick the process off immediately.\n\n---\n\n### 1️⃣ Gather the Essentials\n- **Domain name** (including any sub‑domains you want evaluated).  \n- **Primary target market / language** (helps us prioritize hreflang, local signals, etc.).  \n- **Access to Google Search Console & Google Analytics** (read‑only permission) – optional but speeds up data collection.  \n- **Any specific pain points** you’re already aware of (e.g., “slow LCP on product pages”).\n\n### 2️⃣ Submit Your Request\nChoose the channel that’s most convenient for you:\n\n| Channel | How to Use |\n|---------|------------|\n| **WhatsApp** | Click 👉 [wa.me/919718570218?text=Hi%20WebRanker%20Team%2C%20I%20would%20like%20the%20Free%2048‑Hour SEO Audit](https://wa.me/919718570218?text=Hi%20WebRanker%20Team%2C%20I%20would%20like%20the%20Free%2048‑Hour%20SEO%20Audit) and paste the details from step 1. |\n| **Email** | Send a short note to **info@webranker.in** with the subject line **“Free 48‑Hour SEO Audit Request”** and include the information from step 1. |\n| **Schedule a Consultation** | Click **“Schedule Consultation”** on our website, pick a 15‑minute slot, and we’ll capture the details during the call. |\n\n### 3️⃣ Quick Verification (5‑10 min', '2026-09-24 23:13:24', '2026-09-24 23:13:24'),
(19, 5, 'user', 'Hello', '2026-09-24 23:13:37', '2026-09-24 23:13:37'),
