(22, 5, 'assistant', '### Who We Are — WebRanker\n\nWe are an elite **software engineering, search‑ranking, and digital‑growth agency** that builds ultra‑fast, conversion‑focused digital experiences and then fuels them with relentless organic and paid traffic. Our work is engineered to dominate search, crush page‑speed benchmarks, and turn visitors into high‑value customers.\n\n---\n\n#### 📌 Core Capabilities  \n\n| Area | What We Deliver | Why It Matters |\n|------|----------------|----------------|\n| **High‑Performance Web Development** | • Laravel 12 API & ORM back‑ends<br>• Next.js / Inertia.js React front‑ends (headless, server‑side rendering)<br>• Enterprise SaaS, custom portals, high‑converting e‑commerce | Sub‑second page transitions, 100/100 Lighthouse scores, rock‑solid scalability |\n| **Technical SEO & Keyword Ranking** | • Crawl‑budget & indexation optimization<br>• Programmatic SEO & topical authority clusters<br>• Advanced JSON‑LD schema for Knowledge Graph & rich snippets | Consistent #1 SERP positions, long‑term organic compounding |\n| **PPC & Paid Search** | • Full‑stack Google Ads (Search, Display, Performance Max, Shopping)<br>• Meta & LinkedIn B2B funnels<br>• CRO‑optimized landing pages, rigorous ROI tracking | Zero waste spend, accelerated lead flow, scalable ROI |\n| **Mobile App Engineering** | • Native (Swift, Kotlin) & cross‑platform (Flutter, React Native) apps<br>• Real‑time offline sync, biometric security, sub‑100 ms API latency | Seamless omnichannel experiences for iOS & Android |\n| **AI Automation & Intelligent Workflows** | • Custom autonomous agents, RAG knowledge systems, LLM fine‑tuning, AI chat integrations | Streamlined operations, data‑driven decision making', '2026-09-24 23:13:51', '2026-09-24 23:13:51'),
(23, 5, 'user', 'in which tech you develop web application', '2026-09-24 23:14:32', '2026-09-24 23:14:32'),
(24, 5, 'assistant', '### Technologies We Use to Build High‑Performance Web Applications  \n\n| Layer | Primary Frameworks & Tools | Key Benefits |\n|-------|----------------------------|--------------|\n| **Backend / API** | • **Laravel 12** (PHP) – modern service container, Eloquent ORM, queue workers, API resources<br>• **Node.js (NestJS / Express)** – event‑driven micro‑services, real‑time websockets<br>• **Go (Gin, Fiber)** – ultra‑lightweight services for latency‑critical endpoints | • Rapid development with clean architecture<br>• Built‑in security, authentication (Sanctum, JWT, OAuth2)<br>• Scalable horizontally via Docker/Kubernetes |\n| **Database & Persistence** | • **MySQL 8 / MariaDB** (with Percona optimizations)<br>• **PostgreSQL** (advanced indexing, JSONB)<br>• **Redis** (caching, session store, pub/sub)<br>• **MongoDB** (for flexible document stores) | • ACID compliance, high‑throughput reads/writes<br>• Seamless cache‑first patterns for sub‑100 ms responses |\n| **API Layer & Integration** | • **GraphQL (Apollo Server)** – precise data fetching<br>• **RESTful JSON‑API** – industry‑standard endpoints<br>• **gRPC** – low‑latency binary communication between micro‑services | • Reduce over‑fetching, improve mobile performance<br>• Strong contract testing (Postman, Pact) |\n| **Frontend / UI** | • **Next.js (React) – Server‑Side Rendering (SSR) & Incremental Static Regeneration (ISR)**<br>• **Inertia.js + React** – SPA‑like experience with classic server routing<br>• **Tailwind CSS + Figma‑driven design system** – ultra‑light,', '2026-09-24 23:14:34', '2026-09-24 23:14:34'),
(25, 6, 'user', 'What services do you provide?', '2026-09-24 23:29:19', '2026-09-24 23:29:19'),
(26, 6, 'assistant', 'We specialize in end‑to‑end digital growth and engineering:\n\n• **High‑Performance Web Development** – Laravel 12 APIs, Next.js/Inertia.js React, headless stacks, sub‑second page transitions and 100/100 Lighthouse scores.  \n• **Technical SEO & Organic Ranking** – Crawl‑budget optimization, programmatic SEO, topical clusters, extensive Schema.org/JSON‑LD for Knowledge‑Graph placement.  \n• **PPC & Paid Search** – Full‑funnel Google Ads, Meta & LinkedIn campaigns, CRO‑focused landing pages, zero‑waste spend through smart bidding & negative keywords.  \n• **Mobile App Engineering** – Native (Swift, Kotlin) and cross‑platform (Flutter, React Native) apps with offline sync and sub‑100 ms API latency.  \n• **AI Automation & Intelligent Workflows** – Custom RAG agents, LLM fine‑tuning, chat‑bot integrations.  \n• **UI/UX Design Systems** – Bespoke, CRO‑optimized design language built in Figma.\n\nLet’s discuss your specific goals—what’s the primary outcome you’d like to achieve in the next 3‑6 months?', '2026-09-24 23:29:20', '2026-09-24 23:29:20'),
(27, 6, 'user', 'Tell me in detail about your Custom Web Development services.', '2026-09-24 23:30:29', '2026-09-24 23:30:29'),
(28, 6, 'assistant', '**Custom Web Development – What We Build**\n\n• **Core Architecture** – Laravel 12 API & ORM backbone paired with Next.js or Inertia.js React front‑ends, delivering headless, modular systems that scale effortlessly.  \n• **Performance‑First Engineering** – Sub‑second page transitions, 100/100 Google Lighthouse scores, Core Web Vitals optimization, and server‑side rendering for SEO‑friendly speed.  \n• **Enterprise SaaS & Client Portals** – Multi‑tenant platforms, role‑based access, secure data pipelines, and real‑time dashboards.  \n• **High‑Converting E‑Commerce** – Custom checkout flows, payment gateway integration, inventory sync, and AI‑driven product recommendations.  \n• **Bespoke API Ecosystems** – Public & private APIs, webhook orchestration, and micro‑service readiness for future expansion.  \n\nFor a solution mapped to your exact requirements, let’s schedule a strategy call. What primary business challenge are you looking to solve with a new web platform?', '2026-09-24 23:30:31', '2026-09-24 23:30:31'),
(29, 6, 'user', 'Do you build SaaS applications using Next.js and Laravel?', '2026-09-24 23:31:42', '2026-09-24 23:31:42'),
(30, 6, 'assistant', '**Yes – We build enterprise‑grade SaaS platforms with a Next.js + Laravel stack.**\n\n• **Laravel 12 API Layer** – Robust ORM, authentication, multi‑tenant data isolation, and granular permission systems.  \n• **Next.js Front‑End** – Server‑side rendering for SEO, React component library, incremental static regeneration for ultra‑fast UI updates.  \n• **Scalable Architecture** – Micro‑service ready, queue‑driven background jobs, Docker/Kubernetes deployment options.  \n• **Built‑In SaaS Essentials** – Subscription billing (Stripe/PayPal), usage analytics, role‑based dashboards, and automated onboarding flows.  \n• **Performance & Security** – Sub‑second page loads, OWASP‑compliant hardening, automated CI/CD pipelines.\n\nLet’s explore your product vision—what core features and user flows are top priority for your SaaS?', '2026-09-24 23:31:43', '2026-09-24 23:31:43'),
(31, 6, 'user', 'Can you develop mobile apps in Flutter and React Native?', '2026-09-24 23:32:18', '2026-09-24 23:32:18'),
(32, 6, 'assistant', '**Mobile App Engineering – Flutter & React Native**\n\n• **Flutter** – Cross‑platform UI from a single codebase, native‑level performance, custom animations, offline sync, and seamless integration with Laravel or Node back‑ends.  \n• **React Native** – Reusable JavaScript components, fast iteration cycles, deep linking, and native module support for iOS (Swift) and Android (Kotlin).  \n• **Core Features** – Biometric authentication, real‑time data updates, push‑notification pipelines, and robust CI/CD for automated builds.  \n• **Scalable Deployment** – Dockerized backend services, API‑first architecture, and cloud‑native monitoring.\n\nReady to turn your app idea into a production‑ready product? What primary user problem will the app solve for your audience?', '2026-09-24 23:32:19', '2026-09-24 23:32:19'),
(33, 6, 'user', 'How can you help my website rank higher on Google?', '2026-09-24 23:32:35', '2026-09-24 23:32:35'),
(34, 6, 'assistant', '**Technical SEO Mastery** – Crawl‑budget optimization, server‑side rendering, and schema.org JSON‑LD for rich snippets.  \n**Content & Topical Authority** – Programmatic SEO, cluster content creation, and keyword mapping to dominate competitive search clusters.  \n**On‑Page & Core Web Vitals** – Page‑speed tuning, LCP/CLS/FID fixes, and PWA enhancements for sub‑second loads.  \n**Link Acquisition & Reputation** – White‑hat outreach, digital PR, and contextual backlink building to boost domain authority.  \n**Continuous Monitoring** – Real‑time rank tracking, AI‑driven insights, and monthly health reports to keep performance rising.  \n\nLet’s dive into your SEO goals—what primary keyword or market segment would you like to rank for first?', '2026-09-24 23:32:37', '2026-09-24 23:32:37'),
(35, 6, 'user', 'help in ranking website', '2026-09-24 23:32:51', '2026-09-24 23:32:51'),
(36, 6, 'assistant', '**WebRanker SEO Playbook**\n\n• **Technical Foundations** – Crawl‑budget tuning, server‑side rendering, and Core Web Vitals optimization (LCP, CLS, FID) for lightning‑fast pages.  \n• **Keyword & Content Strategy** – Programmatic SEO clusters, topical authority mapping, and AI‑assisted content briefs to capture high‑intent searches.  \n• **Schema & Rich Snippets** – JSON‑LD implementation for FAQs, reviews, events, and product data to win featured‑snippet real estate.  \n• **Backlink & Reputation Building** – White‑hat outreach, digital PR, and contextual link acquisition to boost domain authority.  \n• **Performance Monitoring** – Real‑time rank tracking, automated audit alerts, and monthly insight reports to keep momentum.  \n\nWhat’s the main product or service you want to dominate in Google search results?', '2026-09-24 23:32:52', '2026-09-24 23:32:52'),
(37, 6, 'user', 'Do you provide local SEO services for businesses?', '2026-09-24 23:33:20', '2026-09-24 23:33:20'),
(38, 6, 'assistant', '**Local SEO Expertise**\n\n• **Google Business Profile** – Full setup, verification, and ongoing optimization of GMB listings for maximum local visibility.  \n• **Citation Management** – Accurate NAP consistency across top directories, automated monitoring, and cleanup of duplicate entries.  \n• **Location‑Targeted Content** – Hyper‑local landing pages, schema markup for address and service area, and community‑focused blog strategies.  \n• **Review & Reputation Engine** – Automated review solicitation, response workflows, and sentiment analysis to boost trust signals.  \n• **Geo‑Weighted Link Building** – Local partnerships, sponsorships, and PR campaigns that earn high‑quality, location‑relevant backlinks.  \n\nReady to dominate your market’s local pack? Which city or region should we prioritize for your business?', '2026-09-24 23:33:21', '2026-09-24 23:33:21'),
(39, 6, 'user', 'Aapki agency kya kya services deti hai?', '2026-09-24 23:33:58', '2026-09-24 23:33:58'),
(40, 6, 'assistant', '**WebRanker की मुख्य सेवाएँ**\n\n• **हाई‑परफ़ॉर्मेंस वेब डिवेलपमेंट** – Laravel 12 API, Next.js/React, हेडलेस आर्किटेक्चर, 100 / 100 Lighthouse स्कोर।  \n• **टेक्निकल SEO & ऑर्गेनिक रैंकिंग** – क्रॉल‑बजट ऑप्टिमाइज़ेशन, प्रोग्रामेटिक कंटेंट क्लस्टर, JSON‑LD स्कीमा, टॉपिकल अथॉरिटी।  \n• **PPC & पेड सर्च** – गूगल ऐड्स, फ़ेसबुक/इंस्टाग्राम, लिंक्डइन कैंपेन, लैंडिंग पेज CRO, ROI‑ट्रैकिंग।  \n• **मोबाइल ऐप इंजीनियरिंग** – Flutter, React Native, iOS (Swift), Android (Kotlin) के साथ रीयल‑टाइम सिंक और बायोमैट्रिक सुरक्षा।  \n• **AI ऑटोमेशन** – कस्टम वर्कफ़्लो एजेंट, RAG नॉलेज सिस्टम, LLM फाइन‑ट्यूनिंग, चैट इंटीग्रेशन।  \n• **UI/UX डिज़ाइन सिस्टम** – CRO‑ऑप्टिमाइज़्ड Figma डिज़ाइन, इंटरैक्टिव कंपोनेंट लाइब्रेरी।  \n\nइनमें से किस सेवा से आप सबसे पहले शुरुआत करना चाहेंगे?', '2026-09-24 23:33:59', '2026-09-24 23:33:59'),
(41, 6, 'user', 'My website is slow and losing rankings. Can you audit it?', '2026-09-24 23:34:41', '2026-09-24 23:34:41'),
(42, 6, 'assistant', '**Website Speed & Ranking Audit**\n\n• **Performance Scan** – Full page‑load analysis (LCP, FID, CLS), server‑response timing, resource‑blocking assets, and lazy‑load gaps.  \n• **Technical SEO Review** – Crawl‑budget health, indexability, duplicate content, schema gaps, and internal linking efficiency.  \n• **Core Web Vitals Check** – Real‑user metrics vs. Google thresholds, recommendations for sub‑second transitions.  \n• **Actionable Report** – Prioritized fixes, code‑level suggestions (Laravel/Next.js), and a roadmap to reclaim rankings.  \n\nSend us your site URL and the CMS/platform you’re using, and we’ll schedule the deep dive. What’s the primary goal you’d like to achieve after the audit—speed, rankings, or conversions?', '2026-09-24 23:34:42', '2026-09-24 23:34:42'),
