(60, 10, 'assistant', '**WebRanker Local SEO Offering**\n\n- **Geo‑Targeted Keyword & Entity Mapping** – Identify high‑intent local search terms and build semantic clusters that dominate “near me” queries.  \n- **Google Business Profile Optimization** – Structured data, NAP consistency, review acquisition strategy, and post‑publishing cadence to boost local pack visibility.  \n- **Citation & Local Backlink Engine** – Audit and secure authoritative local citations, directories, and community backlinks.  \n- **Technical Local Crawl Audit** – Spot geo‑specific crawl budget leaks, schema gaps, and Core Web Vitals issues that affect local rankings.  \n\nWe design a custom roadmap based on your market, competition, and conversion goals. Ready to discuss a free 48‑hour technical SEO audit for your local presence? Connect via WhatsApp +91 97185 70218 or email growth@webranker.com.', '2026-09-25 00:39:00', '2026-09-25 00:39:00'),
