(64, 10, 'assistant', '**WebRanker WordPress Development**\n\n- **Full‑Stack WordPress Architecture** – Custom themes & plugins built on PHP 8.3, Laravel‑style service layers, and modern JavaScript (React/Next.js) for headless or hybrid setups.  \n- **Performance‑First Builds** – Core Web Vitals optimization, lazy‑load assets, server‑side caching, and CDN integration to achieve sub‑second load times.  \n- **Scalable E‑Commerce & Membership** – WooCommerce, subscription models, role‑based access, and secure payment‑gateway integration.  \n- **SEO‑Ready Foundations** – Schema markup, clean permalinks, and automated technical SEO audits baked into every deployment.  \n\nLet’s map your business goals to a tailored WordPress solution. Want a free 48‑hour technical audit to identify quick wins? Reach us on WhatsApp +91 97185 70218 or email growth@webranker.com.', '2026-09-25 00:39:50', '2026-09-25 00:39:50'),
