(82, 15, 'assistant', 'We build websites with a range of modern, SEO‑friendly stacks—choosing the right one based on your project’s size, budget, performance needs, and future growth.\n\n**Our core technology options**\n\n• **Laravel (PHP 8.3)** – Great for enterprise‑grade admin portals, custom business applications, and robust REST/GraphQL APIs.  \n• **Python FastAPI** – Ideal for high‑performance asynchronous APIs, AI/ML services, or micro‑service back‑ends that need sub‑second response times.  \n• **Node.js / Express** – Perfect for JavaScript/TypeScript full‑stack apps, real‑time features (WebSockets), and rapid prototyping of REST or GraphQL services.  \n• **WordPress** – Best for content‑driven sites, blogs, corporate pages, and marketing landing pages where non‑technical editors need easy control.  \n• **React.js** – Used for interactive, component‑driven front‑ends (SPAs, client portals) that require rich UI experiences.  \n• **Next.js** – Combines React with server‑side rendering (SSR) or static‑site generation (SSG) for lightning‑fast load times, excellent Core Web Vitals, and SEO‑ready pages.  \n• **Databases** – MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis (caching & sessions) – selected per data model and scaling requirements.  \n\n**How we pick the right stack**\n\n1. **Project type** – e‑commerce, SaaS dashboard, marketing site, API‑only service, etc.  \n2. **Performance & scalability** – real‑time updates, AI inference, high‑traffic spikes.  \n3. **Content management needs** – who will edit the site and how often?  \n4. **Budget & timeline** – open‑source CMS vs. custom‑coded solution.  \n5. **Future integrations** – payment gateways, CRMs, third‑party APIs, mobile apps.\n\n**Next steps**\n\n• Tell me a bit about the website you envision (purpose, key features, expected traffic).  \n• Let me know if you have any preferred integrations (Stripe, HubSpot, Google Maps, etc.).  \n• Share any design or performance goals (e.g., sub‑second LCP, mobile‑first UI).\n\nWith that info I can recommend the most suitable technology stack and outline the development approach.', '2026-09-25 00:53:46', '2026-09-25 00:53:46'),
